          "derivation": "AC 'PLATFORM session call returns own user context; undelivered slice shows 501 API0501 body' with STERP-PORTAL.md FR-STERP-PORTAL-011 (credentials include, prefilled context headers), platform_getSession (core.usp_GetUserContext of the signed-on login, mapped to SYSADM) and contracts 5.10 API0501; precondition: STERP-SO not delivered; page = API Console https://localhost:7103/ (route '/').",
          "confidence": "inferred"
        }
